    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "ACCUSED_OF",
      "object": "Murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "quote": "“And you don’t even suspect him?” “Why, do you suspect him?” “He is suspected, too.”",
      "disputed": true,
